-- Vienna VA and Wilmette IL: checked directly on the clubs' own pages (2026-10-11). The Bamboo Room labels its open play "NMJL American" and teaches American mahjong;
-- Third Coast Mahjong teaches American-style play with the National Mah Jongg League card. Both list dated sessions with a named address, well above the five-row minimum.
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Vienna''s listing centers on The Bamboo Room, a mahjong social club on Church Street NW. Its open play is labeled NMJL American for all levels, and it teaches American mahjong in Mahjong 101 and 102 lessons, with instructor-led guided play for people who know the basics and skill-building series on weekday mornings. Sessions run most days and fill up, so register ahead on the club''s site.' WHERE "slug" = 'vienna';
UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Wilmette has Third Coast Mahjong, a community on Linden Avenue that teaches American-style mahjong and the National Mah Jongg League card. New players start with Mahj 101, a small class, and can move on to Mahj 102 and 103 and guided open play before joining regular open play, where you bring your own NMJL card (a few loaners are available). Open play runs several times a week.' WHERE "slug" = 'wilmette';
